<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Samsonite Corp to neutral from outperform.  </p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-5/16 to 49-9/16.</p>
</text>
